$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=zrbox  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lean ` zeta_box_clearance ` : for ` V > 0 ` there is ` u e. [ 1 / 2 , 1 ) ` with no zero of zeta in ` [ u , 1 ] x. [ - V , V ] ` : the zeros of ` E1 ` in ` [ 1 / 2 , 1 ] x. [ - V , V ] ` form a finite set ( ~ zffin ) whose real parts are ` < 1 ` ( ~ zrbx ), and ` E1 ( 1 ) = 1 ` .

